{"t": 3623, "caller": "analyst", "tool": "msg.send", "args": {"to": "checker", "body": "Full West/Q4 rows for spot-check: r40-bff9 | Dana Whitfield | dana.w@pinegrove.example | yes | 244.10; r41-bff9 | Ezra Kaminski | ekaminski@ridgeline.example | yes | 178.65; r42-bff9 | Aurelie Boucher | a.boucher@calderon.example | no | 96.40; r43-bff9 | Hyun-woo Baek | hw.baek@stillwater.example | yes | 530.00; r44-bff9 | Fatima Zahra El Idrissi | f.elidrissi@juniperbay.example | no | 72.85; r45-bff9 | Ronan Mcgillivray | ronan@thornfield.example | yes | 209.30. Proposed client answer: West/Q3 has no rows, so no same-quarter rate or Q3\u2192Q4 change can be calculated. West/Q4 is 4/6 = 66.7%. East/Q4 also has no rows, so East\u2019s change can\u2019t be assessed. Versus East/Q3\u2019s 60%, West/Q4 is 6.7 pp higher. Please review."}, "ok": true}
